+/* ── THE RUNTIME STAMP IS THE REAL GUARANTEE ───────────────────────────────── */
+
+/**
+ * The `Forbid<>` types above only bind a call site that passes a precisely-typed
+ * object. `orderRowFor(id, someRecordOfStringUnknown)` — or a spread of one —
