+/**
+ * The service-role client for MONEY WRITES (public.orders / public.payments).
+ *
+ * Identical to createAdminClient() except that it REFUSES the dev anon-key
+ * fallback above. Since SEC-4b (migration 20271008178212) INSERT and DELETE on
+ * both tables are revoked from `authenticated` and `anon`, so an anon-key client
+ * does not degrade gracefully here — every mint becomes a bare 42501 surfaced
+ * through each action's generic "please try again", which is a genuinely
